      "name": "Sahil Suthar",
      "created_at": "2024-09-23T17:31:21.878Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You can use doc.remove() for removing child row.</p>\n<p>Ref:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">doc = frappe.get_doc(\"doctype\", \"docname\")\nfor row in doc.child_table:\n    if condition:\n        doc.remove(row)\ndoc.save()\n</code></pre>",
